week to a global readership. And Ben is the news applications editor at Reuters in New

00:21.680 --> 00:27.800
York City. He has led the creation of an entirely new system for automating charts with the

00:27.800 --> 00:33.580
data wrapper API. So they're here to speak on the automation framework that they use.

00:33.580 --> 00:38.060
It's the very first time that they're revealing this process. And in the interest of not delaying

00:38.060 --> 00:42.160
our peek behind the curtain, I will turn it over to John and Ben.

